<title>FINLAND: ASKO JAN-APRIL PROFIT MORE THAN DOUBLES.</title>
<headline>ASKO JAN-APRIL PROFIT MORE THAN DOUBLES.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to and April, 1997</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	   76.9 vs 37.2</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   1.70 vs 0.70</p>
<p> Net sales					2,218.0 vs  2,359.0</p>
<p> Operating profit				 125.0 vs 103.4</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of eight analysts' forecast for Finnish</p>
<p>plastic pipes, white goods and furniture maker Asko Oy's profit</p>
<p>after financial items had been 107 mln in a 70-173 mln markka</p>
<p>range.</p>
<p> Depreciation				     124.8 vs 131.9</p>
<p> Net financial items		    charge 48.1 vs 66.2 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			gain 76.4 vs 13.9 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					 119.1 vs 12.6</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	   33.2  vs 27.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Asko Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
</text>
